  "title": {
    "zh": "转仓对账",
    "en": "Warehouse Transfer Ledger"
  },
  "concept": {
    "zh": "逐条提交 · 失败不扣货",
    "en": "Sequential transfers · Reject without changing stock"
  },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "stock 按仓名记录库存。transfers 每笔为 [出仓, 入仓, 件数]，两个仓名不同，件数大于 0。按原顺序处理。未登记的仓库存为 0。库存够就扣出仓并增加入仓，成功后即使库存降到 0 也保留仓记录。库存不够，整笔跳过，两个仓的记录都不得改变。返回 [最终库存字典, 被拒的转仓编号列表]，编号从 0 开始。",
    "en": "stock maps warehouse names to stock counts. Each transfer is [source, destination, units], with different warehouse names and positive units. Process in input order. An unlisted warehouse has zero stock. If the source has enough, deduct and credit the stock, keeping a warehouse entry even when it reaches zero. If it lacks stock, skip the entire transfer and leave both entries untouched. Return [final stock dictionary, rejected transfer indices], with indices starting at zero."
  },
  "hints": [],
  "functionName": "audit_transfers",
  "starterCode": "def audit_transfers(stock, transfers):\n    pass\n",
  "solutionCode": "def audit_transfers(stock, transfers):\n    current = {}\n    for warehouse in stock:\n        current[warehouse] = stock[warehouse]\n    rejected = []\n    for index in range(len(transfers)):\n        entry = transfers[index]\n        source = entry[0]\n        target = entry[1]\n        units = entry[2]\n        if source not in current or current[source] < units:\n            rejected.append(index)\n            continue\n        if target not in current:\n            current[target] = 0\n        current[source] -= units\n        current[target] += units\n    return [current, rejected]\n",
